Sprint 1 Experience Goal:
A pilot user should be able to sign in, find a local match/stadium, complete a check-in and find that visit in their history without assistance.

Core flow:
Login → Discover → Match/Stadium → Check-in → Confirmation → Visit History

Experience Lead focus:
Keep the flow simple, ensure every action gives understandable feedback, test the complete flow with pilot users, and convert usability findings into backlog improvements.
